\frac{3^3 - 1}{3^5 + 3^4 - 3^3 - 3^2} = \frac{27 - 1}{243 + 81 - 27 - 9} = \frac{26}{324 + 81 - 27 - 9} = \frac{26}{396} = \frac{13}{198}
